---
<Base
  title={"The pocket POS for stalls, food trucks and cafés"}
  lang={"en"}
  description={"Hugo is a POS that runs on the phone you already own. Orders, receipts, tips and card payments on Android or the Hugo terminal. Live in 5 minutes."}
  ogDescription={"A till that fits in your pocket. Orders, cards, tips and receipts in one app. Live in 5 minutes."}
  image={"/assets/og/og-en.png"}
  imageAlt={"The pocket POS for stalls, food trucks and cafés | Hugo"}
  alternates={{ cs: '/', en: '/en/' }}
  htmlAttrs={{"data-ab-home": ""}}
  schemas={[{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@graph": [{"@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://hugopos.eu/#organization", "name": "Hugo", "url": "https://hugopos.eu/", "logo": "https://hugopos.eu/assets/og/hugo-logo-512.png", "email": "hugo@piano.cz", "sameAs": ["https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/hugopos/", "https://www.facebook.com/jsemhugopos", "https://www.instagram.com/jsem_hugo_pos/"], "parentOrganization": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Piano Solutions s.r.o.", "identifier": "19780974"}}, {"@type": "WebSite", "@id": "https://hugopos.eu/#website", "url": "https://hugopos.eu/", "name": "Hugo", "inLanguage": ["cs", "en"], "publisher": {"@id": "https://hugopos.eu/#organization"}}, {"@type": "SoftwareApplication", "name": "Hugo", "url": "https://hugopos.eu/en/", "inLanguage": "en", "applicationCategory": "BusinessApplication", "applicationSubCategory": "Point of sale", "operatingSystem": "iOS, Android", "publisher": {"@id": "https://hugopos.eu/#organization"}, "offers": {"@type": "Offer", "url": "https://hugopos.eu/en/pricing/", "description": "190 Kč a month excl. VAT when you take card payments through Hugo; cards 1,1 % (MIF++).", "price": "190", "priceCurrency": "CZK", "priceSpecification": {"@type": "UnitPriceSpecification", "price": "190", "priceCurrency": "CZK", "valueAddedTaxIncluded": false, "unitCode": "MON"}}}]}]}
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script is:inline src={hugoAbUrl}></script>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spline+Sans:wght@300..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spline+Sans:wght@300..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<script is:inline type="application/json" id="hugo-strings">{"variants":{"micro":{"eyebrow":"\u003cspan class=\"pip\">★\u003c/span> For food trucks, stalls &amp; solo spots &nbsp;·&nbsp; live in 5 minutes","h1":"A till that \u003cspan class=\"hl\">fits in your pocket.\u003c/span> \u003cem>Live in 5 minutes.\u003c/em>","lead":"No cables, no notice period – and no week-long install. Download the app, snap your price list and take cards on the Android phone you own – or grab a genuinely modern terminal from us. Just 190 Kč a month excl. VAT when you take payments through us.","cta":"Download free \u003csvg class=\"arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003cpath d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\u003c/svg>"},"small":{"eyebrow":"\u003cspan class=\"pip\">★\u003c/span> Made for Czech cafés, bars &amp; restaurants &nbsp;·&nbsp; ready for EET 2.0","h1":"\n        One app runs \u003cbr/>\n        \u003cspan class=\"hl\">the whole place.\u003c/span> \u003cem>On the phone you own.\u003c/em>\n      ","lead":"\n        Hugo is the modern cash register for cafés, bars and restaurants &ndash;\n        orders, menu, tips and VAT in one app on the device you already have.\n        Take card payments on Android, or pair a genuinely modern terminal from us.\n        Either way you&rsquo;re selling in 5 minutes.\n      ","cta":"Start free\n          \u003csvg class=\"arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003cpath d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\u003c/svg>\n        "},"mid":{"eyebrow":"\u003cspan class=\"pip\">★\u003c/span> For restaurants &amp; multi-venue groups &nbsp;·&nbsp; free migration","h1":"The POS that \u003cspan class=\"hl\">scales with your restaurant.\u003c/span> \u003cem>Across every venue.\u003c/em>","lead":"Switch from Dotykačka or Storyous with zero downtime – and none of that week-long, medieval migration. We import your menu. Reports, foodcost, stock and Piano Brain forecasts for every venue in one place.","cta":"Start free\n          \u003csvg class=\"arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003cpath d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\u003c/svg>\n        "}},"chat":{"micro":{"q":"How do I get more out of a market weekend?","ph":"What would you like to know?","a":"\u003cp>Your weekend earners are the \u003cb>chicken wrap\u003c/b> and \u003cb>homemade lemonade\u003c/b> – together almost \u003cb>40%\u003c/b> of sales.\u003c/p>\u003cp>The wrap is \u003cb>119 Kč\u003c/b>; nearby stalls charge \u003cb>135–145 Kč\u003c/b>. Move to \u003cb>129 Kč\u003c/b> – that adds about \u003cb>+1,600 Kč\u003c/b> a weekend and no one blinks.\u003c/p>\u003cp>And prep \u003cb>a fifth more\u003c/b> flatbreads: the last two weekends you sold out by \u003cb>2pm\u003c/b>.\u003c/p>"},"small":{"q":"How do I lift sales on the slow days?","ph":"What would you like to know?","a":"\u003cp>Your weak spot is \u003cb>Tuesday and Wednesday afternoons\u003c/b> – around \u003cb>2,900 Kč\u003c/b> each, a third below Thursday.\u003c/p>\u003cp>On those days try a \u003cb>coffee + cake for 99 Kč\u003c/b> deal. A similar offer lifted your average ticket by \u003cb>14%\u003c/b> on Fridays.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Tips also climb wherever the digital prompt runs – keep it on for every payment and it adds a few hundred a week.\u003c/p>"},"mid":{"q":"How can I improve the margin on my lunch menu?","ph":"What would you like to know?","a":"\u003cp>On your lunch menu, focus on the \u003cb>chicken schnitzel with mash\u003c/b> you sell for \u003cb>165 Kč\u003c/b>. Foodcost runs around \u003cb>82 Kč\u003c/b>, so the margin is only just over \u003cb>50%\u003c/b>.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Nearby, similar dishes sit between \u003cb>185–195 Kč\u003c/b>. The clean move is to raise it to \u003cb>189 Kč\u003c/b> – that puts you at market level and lifts the margin to \u003cb>64%\u003c/b>.\u003c/p>\u003cp>You can also swap the potato for celeriac, which reads more premium (“house celeriac mash”), cutting foodcost a further \u003cb>6 Kč\u003c/b> per plate and pushing the margin to nearly \u003cb>70%\u003c/b>.\u003c/p>"}},"colours":["Red Impulse","Mint Current","Sage Calm","Meadow Honey","Lagoon","Deep Ocean"],"coloursLabel":"Hugo terminal case colours","videoTitle":"Hugo video","eyebrowTitle":"Click for the next audience version","waitlistThanks":"Thanks, we will be in touch soon."}</script>
<script is:inline src={hugoI18nUrl}></script>
<script is:inline src={hugoNavUrl} defer></script>
<script is:inline src={hugoVariantsUrl} defer></script>
<script is:inline>
  /* Every MIF++ link points at the FAQ entry that explains it. A <details> does not
     open itself on a fragment navigation in every browser, so open it here. */
  (function () {
    function openMif() {
      if (location.hash !== '#mif') return;
      var el = document.getElementById('mif');
      if (!el) return;
      el.open = true;
      /* The final resting position comes from scroll-margin-top on .faq-item, because
         the browser's own fragment scroll runs after this one and wins. */
      requestAnimationFrame(function () { el.scrollIntoView({ block: 'start' }); });
    }
    document.addEventListener('click', function (ev) {
      /* A modified click opens a new tab; leave this page as the reader left it. */
      if (ev.metaKey || ev.ctrlKey || ev.shiftKey || ev.altKey || ev.button !== 0) return;
      var link = ev.target.closest && ev.target.closest('a.mif-link');
      if (!link || link.getAttribute('href') !== '#mif') return;
      var el = document.getElementById('mif');
      if (el) el.open = true;
    });
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', openMif);
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', openMif);
  })();
</script>
</Fragment>
<div class="abbar" id="abbar">
  <div class="abbar-in">
    <span class="abbar-label">Version for:</span>
    <button class="ab-arrow" type="button" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Previous version">&lsaquo;</button>
    <div class="ab-seg" id="abSeg">
      <button class="ab-opt is-on" type="button" data-v="micro">Micro / solo</button>
      <button class="ab-opt" type="button" data-v="small">Café &amp; bar</button>
      <button class="ab-opt" type="button" data-v="mid">Restaurant &amp; chain</button>
    </div>
    <button class="ab-arrow" type="button" data-dir="1" aria-label="Next version">&rsaquo;</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="annbar" id="annbar">
  <div class="container annbar-in">
    <span class="annbar-txt"><b>EET returns on 1 January 2027.</b> Move to Hugo now and relax &ndash; with the launch price locked in only until 1 December 2026.</span>
    <a href="#pricing" class="annbar-cta">See how &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <button class="annbar-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
</div>

<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="#" class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/hugo-icon.svg" alt="" width="64" height="64" />
      <span>Hugo</span>
    </a>
    
    <button class="nav-burger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#product">Product</a>
      <a href="#brain">AI &amp; Brain</a>
      <a href="/en/getting-started/">How to start</a>
      <a href="/en/compare/">Compare</a>
      <a href="/en/pricing/">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#reference">Customers</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <div class="lang" id="langToggle"><a href="/" hreflang="cs" lang="cs" data-lang-link>CZ</a><a href="/en/" hreflang="en" lang="en" data-lang-link class="is-on" aria-current="true">EN</a></div>
      <a href="https://admin.hugopos.eu/login?start=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">Start free
        <svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow-row">
        <button class="eb-arrow" type="button" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Previous version">&lsaquo;</button>
        <span class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="pip">★</span> For food trucks, stalls &amp; solo spots &nbsp;·&nbsp; live in 5 minutes</span>
        <button class="eb-arrow" type="button" data-dir="1" aria-label="Next version">&rsaquo;</button>
      </div>
      <h1 class="display">A till that <span class="hl">fits in your pocket.</span> <em>Live in 5 minutes.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">No cables, no notice period – and no week-long install. Download the app, snap your price list and take cards on the Android phone you own – or grab a genuinely modern terminal from us. Just 190 Kč a month excl. VAT when you take payments through us.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="https://admin.hugopos.eu/login?start=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Download free <svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#product" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See it work
          <svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="6 4 20 12 6 20 6 4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <span class="rr"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> No card to start</span>
        <span class="rr"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Live in 5 minutes</span>
        <span class="rr"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Cancel any time</span>
      </div>
      <div class="guarantee">
        <span class="gi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.4 9.4 8 10 4.6-.6 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4z"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg></span>
        <p class="guarantee-txt"><b>14 days free, then 190 Kč a month.</b> If you&rsquo;re not happy, we give you your money back &ndash; no forms, no questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stage">
      <div class="blob"></div>

      <img class="hero-terminal-image" src="/assets/terminal-hugo-prazdroj-1200.webp" srcset="/assets/terminal-hugo-prazdroj-480.webp 480w, /assets/terminal-hugo-prazdroj-800.webp 800w, /assets/terminal-hugo-prazdroj-1200.webp 1200w, /assets/terminal-hugo-prazdroj-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 980px) min(100vw, 740px), 620px" width="1200" height="1070" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Piano terminal running the Hugo POS with a card payment" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="video-band" aria-label="Video">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="video-frame" id="heroVideo">
      <button class="video-facade" type="button" data-video-id="a95ibmg9onA" aria-label="Play the Hugo video">
        <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a95ibmg9onA/maxres1.jpg" alt="" decoding="async" onload="this.onload=null;if(this.naturalWidth<200)this.src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a95ibmg9onA/hq1.jpg'">
        <span class="video-play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="8.5 5.5 19 12 8.5 18.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="refband" id="reference">
  <div class="container">
    <figure class="ref-card">
      <span class="ref-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
      <div class="ref-top">
        <span class="ref-tag">Piano terminal + Hugo</span>
      </div>
      <blockquote>
        <p class="ref-q">I&rsquo;m very happy with the terminal from Piano. You can enter everything right on the terminal &ndash; as individual items or as a quick sale by typing the amount. The Hugo cash register is clear and easy to use. I used to take cash or QR-code payments. <span class="hl">Now everything is simpler and nicer for the customer.</span> Highly recommended.</p>
        <p class="ref-ps">And I&rsquo;d add: great communication with the Piano team.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="ref-who">
        <span class="av" aria-hidden="true">JM</span>
        <span>
          <span class="nm">Josef Marhoul</span><br/>
          <span class="rl">Bar u Lemura stall</span>
        </span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="product">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Any device · one POS</span>
      <h2>One Hugo. <em>iPhone, Android, tablet, terminal &ndash; it all just works.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">No proprietary hardware, no beige box gathering dust by the till. Hand the phone to your waiter, prop the tablet on the bar, plug the terminal in for the rush &ndash; everything syncs in realtime.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="devices">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="device-grid">
          <div class="dev-card dev-iphone">
            <span class="label">iOS</span>
            <h3>iPhone</h3>
            <p>Hugo runs smoothly on iPhone. Keep orders, menu, tips and receipts in one app.</p>
            <div class="art">
              <div class="scr"><img src="/assets/screen-platba-600.webp" width="600" height="1298" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="dev-card dev-android">
            <span class="label">Android</span>
            <h3>Android</h3>
            <p>NFC payments on any modern Android. Same app, same speed, same Brain.</p>
            <div class="art">
              <div class="scr"><img src="/assets/screen-objednat-600.webp" width="600" height="1275" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="dev-card dev-any">
            <span class="label">+ everything else</span>
            <h3>Anywhere you want</h3>
            <p>Tablet at the counter, web in the back office, terminal on the bar, kitchen on a screen.</p>
            <div class="art">
              <div class="chip">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="18" r=".8" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                <span>Tablet</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chip">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 22h8"/></svg>
                <span>Web</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chip">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="3"/><path d="M9 18h6"/></svg>
                <span>Terminal</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tc" id="barvy" aria-label="Hugo terminal case colours">
  <div class="tc-pin">
    <div class="container tc-grid">
      <div class="tc-copy section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">A terminal, your way</span>
        <h2>Fits your bar.<br/><em>And your taste.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">Six case colours, one fast terminal. Pick the one that matches your place, or your staff&rsquo;s mood.</p>
        <p class="tc-note">One case is included with the terminal. Red Impulse is in stock, the other colours are on their way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tc-stage">
        <div class="tc-imgs" id="tcImgs"></div>
        <div class="tc-name" aria-live="polite"><span class="tc-dot" id="tcDot"></span><span id="tcName"></span></div>
        <div class="tc-swatches" id="tcSwatches"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="trust">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="trust-row">
      <span class="trust-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> No notice period &ndash; cancel any time</span>
      <span class="trust-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Card money in your account within 2 days</span>
      <span class="trust-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Ready for EET 2.0</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="floor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">On the floor</span>
      <h2>Fast enough for a <em>Friday-night rush.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Your staff don&rsquo;t read manuals &ndash; and with Hugo they don&rsquo;t have to. From the first order to the paid bill is a handful of taps, so the queue keeps moving and tables turn faster.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="floor-grid">
      <div class="floor-card">
        <div class="shot"><img src="/assets/floor-order-600.webp" width="600" height="1298" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Taking an order from the menu in Hugo" /></div>
        <div class="step">01 &middot; ORDER</div>
        <h3>Order at the table</h3>
        <p>Tap items, add a note, fire it to the kitchen &ndash; without leaving the guest or scribbling on a pad.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="floor-card">
        <div class="shot"><img src="/assets/floor-bill-600.webp" width="600" height="1298" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Reviewing the bill in Hugo" /></div>
        <div class="step">02 &middot; BILL</div>
        <h3>The bill, at a glance</h3>
        <p>Every item, VAT and the total in one place &ndash; add a discount or assign a table before you send it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="floor-card">
        <div class="shot"><img src="/assets/floor-pay-600.webp" width="600" height="1298" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Taking a cash payment in Hugo" /></div>
        <div class="step">03 &middot; PAY</div>
        <h3>Split, tip, take payment</h3>
        <p>Split by item or guest, then take card or cash in one tap &ndash; tip prompt built in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relband">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Built to be relied on</span>
      <h2>A phone till that <em>doesn&rsquo;t flinch.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-grid">
      <div class="rel-item">
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 1l22 22"/><path d="M16.7 11.7A6 6 0 0 1 19 13M5 13a6 6 0 0 1 4-1.7M8.5 16.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3 0"/><path d="M12 20h.01"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Keeps working when the internet drops</h3>
        <p>Wi-Fi drops mid-rush? Keep ringing up orders and cash &ndash; Hugo syncs when you&rsquo;re back, and when EET returns in 2027, receipts queue offline and file themselves.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rel-item">
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="9" width="12" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M6 9V4h12v5"/><path d="M6 16h12v4H6z"/><path d="M9 13h.01"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Use the gear you have</h3>
        <p>Plug in your receipt printer and cash drawer, or go fully paperless. No proprietary box to buy or rent.</p>
